Answers:
Option (A)
def fibonacci(n):
    if n == 10:
        return 55
    elif n == 7:
        return 13
    elif n == 5:
        return 5
    else:
        return None

Option (B):
def fibonacci(n):
    if n <= 1:
        return n
    return fibonacci(n-1) + fibonacci(n-2)

Test cases:
